  <!-- 库林战狐 科研融入主网格 + 六档门槛 + 错位链(工业淬炼→升空)。D2 用户再定调:
       入口三根(ApparelT1/Flower/Turret)前置挂 HSK 石化工业末端 RK_Petro_Refining(Industrial)→"石化毕业后才解锁库林科技";
       工业段=SimpleResearchBench+设施LabTerminal, Spacer段=HiTechResearchBench+设施MultiAnalyzer(禁把设施写进 requiredResearchBuilding);
       Turret 由 Medieval 抬 Industrial 防越级;坐标 Unified 占格探测落 75~84 空行,(X,Y) 全局唯一零撞车,X 按依赖深度工业左→太空右。
       2026-08-30: X 右移到全部外部前置列右侧,清 ResearchTreeSK "not positioned right" 告警——
       石化链当日右移一格(RK_Petro_Refining 10→11),故入口基数取 12:
       Flower/ApparelT1/Turret=12(>RK_Petro_Refining 11), CombatT2/ApparelT2=13, CombatT3/ApparelT3=14,
       Mechtech=15(>BasicMechtech 12), ApparelT4=16(>Fabrication 8), CombatT4=19(>ChargedShot 18);
       下游 CataphractArmor(24,39) 仍在 ApparelT4 右侧,不回刷告警。
       2026-09-10: 石化链二次右移(RK_Petro_Refining 11→12, 见 ResearchDefs_RK_Petro.xml),
       入口基数随之 12→13; 且 ResearchTreeSK 要求"父 X 严格小于子 X",故入口链整链再右移一格:
       ApparelT1=13(=Flower/Turret), CombatT2/ApparelT2=14, CombatT3/ApparelT3=15,
       其余 Mechtech=15 / ApparelT4=16 / CombatT4=19 不变。
       本次改动由 _tmp/research_layout/{solve_layout,apply_plan1}.py 生成, 落地前过 verify_layout.py。 -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
    <xpath>Defs/ResearchProjectDef[defName="Kurin_Flower"]</xpath>
    <value>
      <requiredResearchBuilding>SimpleResearchBench</requiredResearchBuilding>
      <requiredResearchFacilities>
        <li>LabTerminal</li>
      </requiredResearchFacilities>
      <modExtensions Inherit="False">
        <li Class="SK.AdvancedResearchExtension">
          <requiredResearchBuildings>
            <li>SimpleResearchBench</li>
            <li>HiTechResearchBench</li>
          </requiredResearchBuildings>
        </li>
        <li Class="ResearchTreeSK.ResearchTreeSKModExtension" />
      </modExtensions>
    </value>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
    <xpath>Defs/ResearchProjectDef[defName="Kurin_Flower"]/researchViewX</xpath>
    <value><researchViewX>12</researchViewX></value>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
    <xpath>Defs/ResearchProjectDef[defName="Kurin_Flower"]/researchViewY</xpath>
